# HELM-SIGSTORE-OFFLINE-VERIFY-1: hub/vendored/sigstore/node_modules/@sigstore/*
# is COMMITTED vendored third-party source (byte-identical npm-tarball copies,
# hand-placed so bare `require("@sigstore/...")` resolves via Node's normal
# node_modules walk-up — zero `npm install`, see hub/vendored/sigstore/MANIFEST.json),
# not an install artifact. The blanket node_modules//dist/ ignores above exist
# to keep out real `npm install` output; this carve-out un-ignores this one
# specific pinned tree.
!hub/vendored/sigstore/node_modules/
!hub/vendored/sigstore/node_modules/**

# HELM-SDJWT-EMIT-1: hub/vendored/sd-jwt/node_modules/{@sd-jwt,@owf}/* — same
# shape as the sigstore carve-out above: committed byte-identical npm-tarball
# copies of @sd-jwt/core + @owf/identity-common, hand-placed so the vendored
# packages' own bare import/require calls resolve via the node_modules walk-up
# (see hub/vendored/sd-jwt/MANIFEST.json). Not install output.
!hub/vendored/sd-jwt/node_modules/
!hub/vendored/sd-jwt/node_modules/**
